  title: 4) Why is emotional language a potential sign of misinformation?
  answers:
  - "It isn\u2019t because it\u2019s used in every article."
  - It can be used to encourage readers to think critical.
  - Emotional language makes news more entertaining and is encouraged to use.
  - It can be used to rage bait people for engagement.
